All the Main Positions: GK, DEF, MID, FW

Wingers - Wide Wingers, Inside Wingers (Both creative focused and goalscoring focused)

Strikers - Target Man, False 9, Poacher, Basic 

Midfielders - CDFs - Anchor (a more passing oriented), Destroyer (a more tacking oriented person)
              CAMs - Classic 10, Second Strikers, Playmaker
              CMF - Box to Box, Ball Distributor, Orchestrator 

DEF - CBs and FBs

CBs - Ball playing, Sweepers, Aerial, No Nonsense, Destroyer
FBs - Wingbacks, Defensive Fullbacks

Wide Wingers = Crosses, xA, Key Crosses, Accurate Crosses, Dribble Successes
Inside Wingers = Shots per 90, Assists, Goals

Target Man - Headers per 90, Aerials per 90, xG chain, SoT, Ground duels

False 9 - xA, Buildup strength, Key passes, Chance involvement

Paocher - XG, Shots on Target, Goals per 90

Anchor - Pass completion, Long pass accuracy, Buildup, Pass Attempts, Pass Accuracy, Ground Duels, Aerial Duels
Destroyer - Interceptions, Tackles, Ball Recoveries, Duels, Pass Completion 

Classic 10 - Assists, Buildup involvemnt, Key Passes, Dribble success rate, Chances created
Second Strikers - xG buildup, shots, passes made
Playmaker - key share passes, duel success rate, dribbling rate

Box to Box - Buildup, Duels, Fouls, Shots
Ball Distributor - Buildup involvement, ground duels, key passes 

Attacking Fullbacks - Key crosses, Dribbles, Chances Created, Intercptions, Clearances, Duels
Defensive Fullbackls - Tackles, Tackles won, Clearances, Aerial Duels, Fouls, Ground duels 

Ball Playing CBs - Duels won, Aerials, Pass rate, Buildup share, Long passes 
Sweepers - Interceptions, Duels, Aerials
No Nonsense - Interceptions, Clearances, Aerials
Destroyer - Fouls per 90, Interceptions, Clearances, Aerials 
